            },
            "title": "Synthesis"
          },
          {
            "text": {
              "status": "generated",
              "div": "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">Dear colleague, I am writing to inform you about the recent hospital admission of your 30-year-old female patient, admitted on 30/11/2020 with confirmed SARS-CoV-2 infection. Upon admission, she presented with fever, dry cough, and dyspnoea. Chest X-ray and CT confirmed bilateral pneumonia. Blood tests, arterial blood gases, and continuous pulse oximetry were performed to monitor her condition. She required supplemental oxygen therapy and received antiviral and anti-inflammatory medication, alongside intravenous fluids. Clinical progress was satisfactory, with gradual improvement in respiratory function and inflammatory markers. She was discharged on 02/12/2020 in a recovering state with instructions for home isolation, symptomatic treatment, and follow-up. Please arrange a follow-up appointment within two weeks and monitor for post-COVID complications. Do not hesitate to contact me for further information.</div>"
            },
